Gorgeous new location for a wonderful New York restaurant. Not only is the food and ambience excellent, but i also experienced incredible hospitality ina tough situation here.

Made a reservation for a party of 10 via OpenTable. My party waited around for 15-20 mins past out reservation time, and when we kept getting told that out table wasnt ready yet, we were a confused, frustrated, and ready to make a new plan. Apparently the restaurant uses both Resy and OpenTable for its reservation system and the systems weren't clicking yet. So they'd been experiencing issues like this before. The host clearly explained this to us, apologized for our wait and confusion, and cleared up some bar space for my group with a round of drinks and apps on the house. We expected that would be our station for the night, but within 20 minutes, a table was available for us. We were so appreciative of the kindness and humanity we were met with, when they could have just let us go, the way so many New York restaurants would have done.

Dinner was again, DELICIOUS. (The roasted eggplant: GET IT!) Service was so sweet--we kept joking around about my nephews birthday, and out came a candle with dessert. They turned a small family meet up into a truly special reunion, and I want to give them all the success and business in return!
